<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Site em Manutenção</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .icon-container {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
            color: #818cf8;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
        }

        .icon-container svg {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            color: #818cf8;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.875rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            background: #0f172a;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #38bdf8;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.9); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-container">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17 17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0 0 21 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 1 1-3.586-3.586l5.654-4.654m0 0a3.003 3.003 0 0 1 .765-1.208l3.03-2.496m-3.795 3.704a3.003 3.003 0 0 1 1.208-.765l3.03-2.496M15.75 3.75l1.5 1.5-2.25 2.25m3.75-1.5 1.5 1.5-2.25 2.25" />
            </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="badge">UPDATE...</span>
        <h1>Estamos atualizando a lista</h1>
        <p>Estamos realizando atualizações para trazer novidades e uma experiência ainda melhor. Por favor seja paciente!</p>

        <div class="status">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            <span>Atualização em andamento</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
